      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should not self-medicate with tramadol without a valid prescription from your doctor or a pharmacist on call, as tramadol can interact dangerously with sertraline and requires professional oversight. Even if your back pain is severe, purchasing medications online or over the counter without a prescription is illegal in most regions and may not address the confusion between legitimate painkillers like tramadol and safer alternatives like acetaminophen or ibuprofen. Please contact your doctor, a local urgent care, or a nurse hotbed immediately for a legitimate emergency prescription or instructions to get you the proper care you need today.",
