    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i understand the serotonin thing but i've read online that people take them together all the time if they are careful. honestly i'm just desperate for relief so i'm thinking about just taking one tramadol pill tonight to see if it even helps before i deal with the doctor stuff. if i just take one small dose and wait to see how i feel, is there really that much risk or is it just a precaution?",
